Commit:     welpy-cw <h.w.forms@arcor.de>
CommitDate: Sun Feb 1 08:03:45 2026 +0000

    Bug 2012697 - Migrate filter logging and editor validation strings to Fluent. r=mkmelin,sking

    - Migrates strings from filter.properties to filterEditor.ftl.
    - Refactors nsMsgFilter::LogRuleHitGeneric to utilize stack-allocated nsAutoCStringN
      buffers, significantly reducing heap allocations during logging.
    - Shifts the filter logging pipeline from UTF-16 to UTF-8 C-strings for better
      memory efficiency and modern API compatibility.
    - Implements a constexpr lookup table for filter action localization IDs.
    - Updates searchWidgets.js to utilize multi-file Fluent localization.
    - Ensures consistent hexadecimal formatting for error codes in log output.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D280586

